<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">The harbour</text:h>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">It was <text:span text:style-name="Strong">cold</text:span> on the <text:span text:style-name="Under">quay</text:span>, and the <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://example.org/tides">tide tables</text:a> were wrong. wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp.</text:p>
<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body"><text:span text:style-name="Hidden">A note to self. </text:span>She packed:</text:p>
<text:list text:style-name="Bullets"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">rope</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">a lamp</text:p></text:list-item></text:list>
<text:list text:style-name="Numbers"><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">first the boat</text:p></text:list-item><text:list-item><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">then the road</text:p></text:list-item></text:list>
<text:section text:name="Letter"><text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat lamp gull stone tide rope wind salt boat.</text:p></text:section>
